{"id":"npc:%E5%B8%95%E5%A4%AB%E6%B4%9B","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"短视，怯懦，自私，典型的乌萨斯贵族，靠家里捐钱得了个男爵，如今家境落寞。卡托加事件中被格罗莫夫抓来算账，意外在据点中被伯塔尼控制并带回营地，在拷问下为学生团体提供了格罗莫夫的情报，最终在索尼娅据理力争下保全性命。","spoiler":true,"source":""}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2174_1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2174_1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_2174_1$1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act51side/level_act51side_06_beg","lineCount":13,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":577,"line":578,"speaker":"帕夫洛","text":"格罗莫夫申请了那么多物资，我怎么一个都没看到……"},{"commandIndex":578,"line":579,"speaker":"帕夫洛","text":"不对，采购价比市场价高出不少，账目上“十六勇士”的工资也远比实际的多。"},{"commandIndex":630,"line":631,"speaker":"帕夫洛","text":"明白，明白……"}]},{"story":"activities/act51side/level_act51side_06_end","lineCount":3,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":582,"line":583,"speaker":"帕夫洛","text":"索尼娅！索尼娅！看这里！"},{"commandIndex":583,"line":584,"speaker":"帕夫洛","text":"管管你的人！"},{"commandIndex":589,"line":590,"speaker":"帕夫洛","text":"你在说什么——救命！"}]}]}